 "prompts": {
  "hero": "Repaint this grey clay model as a finished, highly detailed painted game sprite of a colossal alien bio-organic carrier warship seen from above and in front, in the style of a high-resolution sci-fi capital ship concept painting. Materials: dark violet-black chitin carapace in overlapping organic scales and long armour strakes, satin and weathered like old horn, never glossy, with dusky violet highlights on the edges, ivory bone spines, ribs and thorns, dark wine-red membranes stretched between ribs, glowing violet psionic crystal growths where the clay is violet, small hot ember-orange glowing organic gun ports where the clay is orange. The weapons are grown bone thorns and glowing pores, not machinery. Only the three black rectangles are openings: deep black empty hangar mouths; everything around them is solid armoured chitin. Organic, alien, ancient and menacing, enormous scale with dense fine detail, no metal panels, no windows. Keep the outline, every shape, the pose and the viewing angle exactly. Solid flat green background (#00FF00), no checkerboard, no shadow.",
  "hero_set_thorn": "The armour is jagged and thorny, bristling with racks of bone thorn blades and long armour strakes.",
  "hero_set_lattice": "Violet crystal lattices grow through the carapace in columns and veins, glowing softly.",
  "hero_set_shroud": "The carapace is smooth and layered like overlapping beetle wing cases, heavy and armoured.",
  "stage_S1": "Same ship, same pose, framing and colours. The violet crystals flicker dim and cracked; scorched soot streaks and fine glowing ember hairline cracks spread across the chitin scales. The black hangar openings stay black and empty, no fire inside them. Keep the green background.",
  "stage_S2": "Same ship, same pose and framing. The armour scales are torn away in many places, exposing glowing ember-red sinew and bone ribs underneath; the violet crystal pylons are shattered stumps; small fires and sparks along the torn edges. The black hangar openings stay black and empty, no fire inside them. Keep the green background.",
  "stage_S3": "Same ship, same pose and framing, now breaking apart: deep molten cracks through the carapace, broken spines and snapped ribs, burning breaches, black smoke wisps inside the hull outline. The black hangar openings stay black and empty, no fire inside them. Keep the green background.",
  "hero_tour_2": "Bigger and more armed: hot brood light glows deep inside the flank hangar maws, and a second battery of gun blisters lines each prong.",
  "hero_tour_3": "Heavier still: thick layered armour with glowing ember seams, palisades of bone stakes walling the hangar deck, barbed tendrils trailing from the prong tips.",
  "hero_tour_4": "Scarred, thicker plating, crowns of spikes on every terrace, translucent brood sacs glowing from within, three batteries of gun blisters.",
  "hero_tour_5": "The darkest chitin with molten seams, a blazing crown of great violet crystal blades on the citadel, every surface bristling with thorns and gun ports.",
  "refine": "Same image, same composition, same colours and lighting. Add fine surface detail: chitin scale edges, tiny bone thorns, membrane veins, crystal facets. Keep every shape, edge and dark opening exactly where it is. Keep the green background.",
  "negative": "text, letters, watermark, logo, signature, ui, frame, border, blurry, photo, multiple views, grid, sky, ground, landscape, checkerboard, shadow, face, eyes, mouth, teeth, skull, rivets, metal panels, windows, machinery, pipes, metal cannon barrels, studs, buttons, glossy plastic, toy, cyan, teal, blue glow, human, cartoon, cute"
 },
